"{\"content\":\"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>\\n<!-- ============================================================\\n     DRAFT PLACEHOLDER — INCOMPLETE — NOT A REAL PROCESS DEFINITION\\n     ============================================================\\n     Status : DRAFT (isExecutable=\\\"false\\\", inert)\\n     Purpose: Structural skeleton only. Every {{...}} token must be\\n              replaced with user-provided details (process identity,\\n              target engine, steps, decision points, events) before\\n              this file is considered meaningful.\\n     Missing inputs required to complete:\\n       1. Process identity (name, scope, boundaries)\\n       2. Target format/engine (Camunda, Zeebe, Flowable, ...)\\n       3. Ordered process steps (automated vs. user tasks)\\n       4. Decision points and branch conditions\\n       5. Roles/lanes            (deliberately omitted)\\n       6. Start/intermediate/end events\\n       7. Exception/compensation paths (deliberately omitted)\\n       8. Data objects           (deliberately omitted)\\n       9. System integrations    (deliberately omitted)\\n     ============================================================ -->\\n<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn=\\\"http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL\\\"\\n                  id=\\\"Definitions_PLACEHOLDER\\\"\\n                  targetNamespace=\\\"http://example.com/placeholder\\\"\\n                  exporter=\\\"draft-placeholder\\\">\\n  <bpmn:process id=\\\"Process_PLACEHOLDER\\\"\\n                name=\\\"{{PROCESS_NAME}}\\\"\\n                isExecutable=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\n    <!-- Start: trigger unknown -->\\n    <bpmn:startEvent id=\\\"Start_1\\\" name=\\\"{{START_TRIGGER}}\\\">\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_s_t1</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:startEvent>\\n\\n    <!-- Single representative step; real step list unknown -->\\n    <bpmn:task id=\\\"Task_1\\\" name=\\\"{{STEP_1_NAME}}\\\">\\n      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_s_t1</bpmn:incoming>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_t1_g1</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:task>\\n\\n    <!-- Decision: condition unknown -->\\n    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id=\\\"Gateway_1\\\" name=\\\"{{DECISION_1_QUESTION}}\\\">\\n      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_t1_g1</bpmn:incoming>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_g1_end1</bpmn:outgoing>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_g1_end2</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>\\n\\n    <bpmn:endEvent id=\\\"End_Success\\\" name=\\\"{{END_STATE_SUCCESS}}\\\"/>\\n    <bpmn:endEvent id=\\\"End_Failure\\\" name=\\\"{{END_STATE_FAILURE}}\\\"/>\\n\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\\"Flow_s_t1\\\"  sourceRef=\\\"Start_1\\\"   targetRef=\\\"Task_1\\\"/>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\\"Flow_t1_g1\\\" sourceRef=\\\"Task_1\\\"    targetRef=\\\"Gateway_1\\\"/>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\\"Flow_g1_end1\\\" sourceRef=\\\"Gateway_1\\\" targetRef=\\\"End_Success\\\"\\n                        name=\\\"{{CONDITION_PASS}}\\\"/>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\\"Flow_g1_end2\\\" sourceRef=\\\"Gateway_1\\\" targetRef=\\\"End_Failure\\\"\\n                        name=\\\"{{CONDITION_FAIL}}\\\"/>\\n  </bpmn:process>\\n</bpmn:definitions>\\n\",\"path\":\"workflows/PLACEHOLDER-process-draft.bpmn\"}"